# Burning Steppes & Azshara (51-52): Flame Crest and Dreadmaul Rock, then Valormok and the Blackmaw
# of Ursolan, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/burning_steppes_azshara_51_52.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Burning Steppes, area 46;
# Azshara, area 16). The guide's quest list is section 17 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Left out: Dark Iron Legacy (3802), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136) and The Heart of the Mountain (4123):
# done inside Blackrock Depths. Sisters In Duty (98096): its giver is in Darnassus and it follows an
# Alliance quest. Remote Contact 91734 (Undercity) and 91737 (Thunder Bluff): the same quest as
# 91735 from Orgrimmar, only one of the three can be done.
# Carried: Dreadmaul Rock (3821), taken from Thal'trak Proudtusk in Kargath.
# Left to later guides: Felnok Steelspring (4808, Everlook) and Delivery to Jes'rimon (3541,
# Orgrimmar) for Felwood & Winterspring (52-53); Delivery to Magatha (3518, Thunder Bluff) and March
# of the Silithid (4494, Gadgetzan) for Un'Goro Crater (53-54).
#
# The route: Franclorn in Blackrock Mountain; Flame Crest; the east (Dreadmaul Rock, the broodlings,
# Cyrus Therepentous); Kargath and back for The Rise of the Machines; the reavers and the Ruins of
# Thaurissan; Kargath again, Grom'gol and the zeppelin to Orgrimmar; a flight to Splintertree Post
# and the road into Azshara; Valormok and its fields; the Ruins of Eldarath and the shore; Ursolan
# and the Legashi camps; back by Valormok to Loh'atu and out west toward Felwood.

guide Burning Steppes & Azshara (51-52)
faction horde
levels 51 52
carry 3568 3821 3908 4120
leave 3518 3541 3568 3908 4120 4494 4808
next Felwood & Winterspring (52-53)

# Blackrock Mountain ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Burning Steppes
accept 3801
tip Franclorn's spirit stands on his monument in the middle of Blackrock Mountain and only the dead see him: fall into the lava, release, and walk back as a ghost.
turnin 3801
tip His next task is inside Blackrock Depths: leave it. Resurrect at your body and step out of the lava quickly.

# Flame Crest ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fpath 13177
tip Leave Blackrock Mountain by the Burning Steppes side and ride east to the orc camp on the ridge.
accept 4726
accept 4296
tip Maxwort's Heart of the Mountain and Yuka's Ribbly Screwspigot are Blackrock Depths quests: leave them.

# The east: Dreadmaul Rock, the broodlings and Cyrus ----------------------------------------------------

do 4726 bg
tip Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling, kill it, then pick up the essence it leaves.
turnin 3821
tip Sha'ni's remains lie on the altar at the top of Dreadmaul Rock: click them and her spirit appears.
accept 3822
do 3822
tip Krom'Grul walks the caves of Dreadmaul Rock, just north of the altar.
grind 52 at 88.5,45.0
tip Cyrus and Kargath's next quest want level 52: kill the broodlings and ogres on the way east until you get there.
accept 4022
tip Cyrus waits in the small cave at the eastern edge. This one is for whoever has the Black Dragonflight Molt: open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight from Trinkets... in the Searing Gorge.
do 4022.1 at 95.1,31.6 icon use "Open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight for its Black Dragonflight Molt"
do 4022.2 icon talk "Show the Black Dragonflight Molt to Cyrus Therepentous"
turnin 4022
accept 4023
tip Without the molt, Cyrus asks for proof instead.
do 4023
tip The Frenzied Black Drake is a level 54 elite next to Cyrus' cave: fight it together.
turnin 4023
do 4726
tip The broodlings fly in small groups along the eastern cliffs, around Cyrus' cave and south of Dreadmaul Rock.

# Flame Crest, and Kargath ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 4726
accept 4808
tip Felnok is in Everlook: the next guide hands this in.
fly "Kargath, Badlands" npc 13177
map Badlands
turnin 3822
accept 4061
fly "Flame Crest, Burning Steppes" npc 2861

# The reavers and the Ruins of Thaurissan ---------------------------------------------------------------

map Burning Steppes
do 4061 mobs 7039 7032 228725
tip War Reavers walk the slopes just south of Flame Crest; the Greater Obsidian Elementals and Firesworn drop shards too.
do 4296 icon use "Transcribe the Tablet of the Seven"
tip The tablet stands in the Ruins of Thaurissan, west of the reavers.
turnin 4296

# Kargath, Grom'gol and Orgrimmar --------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Kargath, Badlands" npc 13177
map Badlands
turnin 4061
fly "Grom'gol, Stranglethorn" npc 2861
map Stranglethorn Vale
note "Take the zeppelin from the Grom'gol tower to Orgrimmar" at 31.5,29.5
map Orgrimmar
bind 6929
ah 91610.1 npc 8673
tip Kurll in Azshara wants 10 Winter Squid. Fishers can catch them on the Azshara coast instead.
accept 4494
tip Zilzibin is in the Drag. This one is handed in at Gadgetzan in a later guide.
accept 91735
tip Jes'rimon hides upstairs in one of the tall buildings of the Drag.
accept 3504
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
fly "Splintertree Post, Ashenvale" npc 3310
tip Ride east from Splintertree Post along the road into Azshara. With the Valormok flight path, fly there instead and take Loh'atu's quests at the end.

# Into Azshara: Loh'atu, Shadowsong Shrine and the Haldarr ------------------------------------------------

map Azshara
accept 5535 5536
tip Loh'atu camps by the road at Talrendis Point, just inside Azshara.
do 5535
tip The Highborne spirits haunt Shadowsong Shrine, north of Loh'atu.
do 5536
tip The Haldarr satyrs camp on the hill south of Valormok. Hand both in at the end, on the way out.

